15
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capturedAt"

2026-11-08T10:00:00.000Z
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceId"

device_manual_demo_01
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
