camera
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="note"

Ngập nặng ngã tư Amata, xe chết máy
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="flood_test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./uploads/.gitkeep
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

